WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.910
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.339
Do you worry about a zombie uprising?

00:00:04.339 --> 00:00:08.690
Well fear not, the US Department of Defense
has you covered.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:15.540
The Pentagon has created a comprehensive plan
detailing how to counter a zombie apocalypse.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:22.290
Created in 2011 it’s called “CONPLAN 8888”
and outlines the precise steps the US Government

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.770
and military would take to combat a zombie
uprising.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:30.800
I know what you’re thinking, this must be
a joke, the government can’t possibly have

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.719
spent hundreds of man hours on preparing this
document.

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:40.890
Well fortunately for obsessive tinned food
hoarders, it’s no joke.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:46.089
But don’t worry, as far as we know the government
isn’t expecting a zombie attack.

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:49.960
The plan was actually created as part of a
training exercise for security personnel at

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:54.440
the Pentagon, but when they finished writing
the document, they thought it was so damn

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.899
good that they ought to keep it, you know,
just in case.

00:00:57.899 --> 00:01:02.330
It now resides hidden away deep inside the
Pentagon’s secret network of files, right

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:07.750
alongside plans such as what to do in case
of nuclear war or a civil uprising, for example.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:11.740
But luckily for us the document has been unclassified.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:16.480
And yes it actually has a pretty picture of
a zombie on the front cover, they just couldn’t

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.010
help themselves could they.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:22.020
So what does this zombie master-defense plan
contain?

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:26.710
The document first describes the eight different
types of zombies, because you need to know

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.780
exactly what you’re dealing with before
you can defeat it.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:35.550
The first type is Pathogenic Zombies, this
is your bog-standard zombie, created when

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:40.810
a life form is infected by a rogue virus or
bacteria, you know, like in practically every

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.760
zombie film ever.

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:48.380
Second are Radiation Zombies, created when
an organism is subjected to an extreme dosage

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.730
of radiation.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:55.570
Thirdly, Evil Magic Zombies, yes, the Pentagon
actually came up with that name.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.640
I’ll let the document itself explain this
one, since they worded it so eloquently: “EMZ's

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:06.980
are zombie life forms created via some form
of occult experimentation in what might otherwise

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:12.730
be referred to as "evil magic"”, and to
think, this was actually written by the people

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.940
running the defense sector of the world’s
largest superpower.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:22.560
Next are Space Zombies, not much explanation
needed here, they’re zombies that come from

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.000
outer space.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.269
After that we have Weaponized Zombies, these
are zombies that are intentionally created

00:02:28.269 --> 00:02:33.780
by an enemy group or state via bio-mechanical
engineering to be used as a weapon against

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.069
America.

00:02:35.069 --> 00:02:40.319
At number six, is Symbiant-Induced Zombies,
this is when another life form latches onto

00:02:40.319 --> 00:02:45.630
an organism and controls its brain and therefore
their body, in a zombie-like manner.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:51.440
This actually happens to ants, when they become
infected with a fungus known as codyceps,

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.629
they turn into zombie-ants.

00:02:53.629 --> 00:02:55.840
Could it happen to humans too?

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:56.840
Possibly.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:05.299
Next are Vegetarian Zombies, they pose no
direct threat to humans but their obsession

00:03:05.299 --> 00:03:11.989
with eating crops could cause massive de-forestation
and eliminate food-sources worldwide, causing

00:03:11.989 --> 00:03:13.939
mass starvation.

00:03:13.939 --> 00:03:21.480
The CONPLAN 8888 document actually notes that
instead of moaning “braiiinnnnnnssss”,

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:25.120
vegetarian zombies would most likely say “graiiinnnnsssss”.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:32.040
And lastly we have the scariest zombie type
of all: “Chicken Zombies”.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:37.799
Now, chicken zombies may sound utterly ridiculous
but these are the only type of zombie that

00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:40.459
actually exists today.

00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:44.410
When an old hen is to be euthanised because
it can no longer lay eggs, a gas is used to

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.690
end its life and it is buried underground.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:51.950
However, if the euthanisation was performed
incorrectly, for instance if an incorrect

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:57.290
dosage of gas is used, then after a few days
underground, the chicken can actually come

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:02.620
back to life and dig its way out of the ground
in a zombie-like manner, then stumble around

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:06.709
aimlessly for a while, before its internal
organs eventually fail.

00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:12.590
There have been numerous documented cases
of this happening in farms all over the world.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:17.239
Zombie chickens don’t pose any threat to
human life but the Pentagon obviously thinks

00:04:17.239 --> 00:04:21.370
they’re terrifying enough to warrant a place
in their zombie defense plan.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:26.650
So that’s the preliminaries covered, but
what steps does the US government plan to

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:32.430
take if any of these eight types of zombies
where to start a zombie uprising?

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:36.960
The country would first go into a state of
Martial Law in an attempt to maintain order

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.180
and allow appropriate force to be used against
the zombie horde.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:46.009
The CDC would also be called in to help control
the spread of infection between hosts.

00:04:46.009 --> 00:04:51.090
Interestingly the plan notes that zombies
are neither classified as human nor animal

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:56.090
life and therefore the military is free to
completely bypass human and animal rights

00:04:56.090 --> 00:05:01.590
laws when counterattacking the zombies.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:05.900
The document makes essential observations
about zombie behaviour, I don’t know where

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:11.030
they got their research from but presumably
the Pentagon just binge-watched zombie flicks.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:17.710
The plan notes that zombies can’t be reasoned
with and don’t fear pain or death, therefore

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:23.169
riot-control strategies would be completely
useless and the only way to effectively deal

00:05:23.169 --> 00:05:26.040
with them is a shot to the head.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:30.990
Once killed a zombie cadaver should be burned
to prevent the spread of pathogens and possible

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.050
reanimation of the corpse.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:38.880
Oh and zombies can’t swim, the document
makes this very clear throughout, therefore

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.639
rivers and other waterways would be the recommended
escape route for most citizens.

00:05:43.639 --> 00:05:47.960
All the various measures that the plan suggests
for dealing with the zombie horde are neatly

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.360
segmented into five key steps in the document…

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:57.060
Shape, Deter, Seize Initiative, Dominate and
Stabilize.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:06:01.990
The last step involves finding and eliminating
the very last zombie strongholds and restoring

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.050
basic services to communities.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:25.210
Sadly, at no point does the Pentagon’s plan
suggest going down the Winchester for 

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:30.210
a pint, shameful really.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:35.009
Thanks for watching.

